Numerical routines are adapted from the accompanying project's exact finite-MDP
oracle and exact branch-weighting experiment. The needed arithmetic oracle is
included in exact_oracle.py, so the parent repository is not a runtime dependency.

The inverse-square-root heuristic is motivated by TreeRL's descendant-count
scaling. Only this aggregation factor is compared here. No TreeRL training
framework, empirical GA/LA target, entropy-based sampler, or pretrained model
is imported or evaluated by this package.
